                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a adventure game, so I won't talk about the gameplay.\nThe strongest thing about this game is it's story and everything related to it.\nThe story is pretty interesting and it did keep me hooked to the screen despite not having a shocking twist or big reveal.\nIt is a simple story, but quite an enjoyable one.\nSix endings.\nAn excellent story, many choices, awesome and hidden secrets.\nWhat more do you need for an excellent adventure?",
